  Dark:  background #0B1020, foreground #E5E7EB, card #121832, border #1F2847, muted #171F3D, muted-foreground #94A3B8
  primary #4F46E5 (indigo-600) with primary-foreground #FFFFFF; accent #14B8A6 (teal); success #16A34A; warning #F59E0B; destructive #DC2626. Add --success and --warning as tokens and use them as text-success / bg-success/10 etc.
- Radius 0.75rem. Cards: rounded-2xl, 1px border, subtle shadow, p-5/p-6. Buttons: rounded-xl. Generous whitespace, clear hierarchy.
- Signature gradient (for hero, brand panel, primary CTAs): from-indigo-600 via-violet-600 to-fuchsia-500 as the utility class "bg-brand-gradient" defined in globals.css.
- Fully responsive (mobile-first, test at 375px, 768px, 1280px). Accessible: labels, aria-labels on icon buttons, visible focus rings, color is never the only signal.
- Tone: encouraging, professional, student-friendly. Microcopy is short and human.

ROUTES (fixed)
/ landing (public) | /sign-in, /sign-up (public, Clerk) | /dashboard | /setup | /session/[sessionId] (interview room) | /results/[sessionId] | /history

SHARED TYPES: lib/types.ts (create EXACTLY this content if the file does not exist; import from "@/lib/types", never redefine)
export type InterviewType = 'technical' | 'hr' | 'mixed'
export type Difficulty = 'beginner' | 'intermediate' | 'advanced'
