- components/shared/config-badges.tsx   <ConfigBadges config: InterviewConfig />  (type, domain, difficulty, language as small badges)
APP SHELL: (app)/layout.tsx wraps pages in a left sidebar (Dashboard, New Interview, History) + top bar (Clerk <UserButton />, theme toggle). Pages in the (app) group render ONLY their own content inside <main>; they must not render their own sidebar/navbar. For preview purposes in your own project you may create a temporary (app)/layout.tsx; it will be discarded on merge.

